00:44:12,580 --> 00:44:15,040
The Lord gets redemption done.

511
00:44:16,160 --> 00:44:24,880
She asked Ruth how it went, and was likely blown away that Ruth went above and beyond to not just pursue a marriage for herself, but redemption for Naomi and the lineage of the family.

512
00:44:24,880 --> 00:44:28,900
God gets redemption done, whether we participate or not.

